<title>INDIA: WSC-India Rice Weather, Sept 16.</title>
<headline>WSC-India Rice Weather, Sept 16.</headline>
<text>
<p>SUMMARY- Rain 0.25-2.50 inches (6-64 mm) through most of southern, central, and northeastern India. Dry elsewhere. Highs 82-98F (28-37C). CROP IMPACT- Mostly favorable conditions for developing rice at this time.</p>
<p>FORECAST-</p>
<p>TODAY...Showers up to 1.00 inch (25 mm) in much of central and southern India. Mostly fair with isolated showers to the north. Highs 82-97F (28-36C).</p>
<p>TONIGHT...Lingering showers in central and southern India. Dry to the north. Lows 66-77F (19-25C).</p>
<p>TOMORROW...Little change from today's weather expected.</p>
<p>OUTLOOK...Showers over southern India, isolated showers in central areas, and mostly dry elsewhere Wednesday-Friday. Temperatures near to above normal.</p>
<p>Source: Weather Services Corporation</p>
